{
  "_notes": [
    "This reconstructs the roster the shipping gfx/atlas/atla.dds.zlib was built from (see atlas_metadata3.lua), with two corrections found while rebuilding it through the new one-step pipeline:",
    "1. Paths under the old gfx/3d/sdr2/ folder were fixed to where those files actually live now (gfx/3d/*.png, gfx/vehicles/car.png, gfx/vehicles/bike.png).",
    "2. Those 7 single-item turntable sheets (gun, launchergun, portalGun, car, bike, apple_2, commodore64) are all 640px wide today. The old commented-out main.lua call used directions=1 for them, which only reads the leftmost 128px column and would silently produce a garbled 1/5-width atlas. directions=5 is what actually matches: 640/5=128px per column, and rows*5 reproduces the exact frame counts recorded in the shipping atlas_metadata3.lua (455, 460, 450, 460, 460, 455, 455) — strong evidence 5 is correct and 1 was stale/wrong, not a deliberate choice.",
    "3. Four sources from the old config no longer exist anywhere in the repo (gfx/TileSet/tree1.png, arch.png, coin128.png, house128.png) and are omitted here — their characterDefinitions entries (tree/arch/coin/house) are dropped too. Re-add them once those sprites are re-sourced."
  ],
